kill me over some slut?


01:12:02.861 --> 01:12:04.528
Yeah. I don't know.


01:12:05.463 --> 01:12:07.130
Look at her, man.


01:12:07.465 --> 01:12:08.799
Look at her.


01:12:11.502 --> 01:12:13.203
