01:14:38.482 --> 01:14:39.683
Where did she go?


01:14:41.284 --> 01:14:42.518
I don't know.


01:14:48.392 --> 01:14:50.260
Should we swim for it?


01:14:50.262 --> 01:14:52.394
We paddle.
We're making progress.


01:14:52.396 --> 01:14:53.729
I mean,
we don't even know if that


01:14:53.731 --> 01:14:55.197
bitch is gonna
create a distraction...


01:14:55.199 --> 01:14:56.432
Shut up!


01:15:01.237 --> 01:15:02.738
What's the matter, Matty-Matt?
Huh?


01:15:04.040 --> 01:15:05.975
- You got remorse?
- Shut up!


01:15:09.413 --> 01:15:10.613
Okay.


01:15:11.414 --> 01:15:13.282
I'm sorry. All right.


01:15:24.361 --> 01:15:26.128
Oh, man, my head!


01:15:29.133 --> 01:15:30.066
Stop!


01:15:38.208 --> 01:15:39.208
Ow!


01:15:41.712 --> 01:15:43.612
Matt, stop it! Hey!


01:15:52.189 --> 01:15:53.322
Simon!


01:15:57.594 --> 01:15:59.161
Simon!


01:16:02.233 --> 01:16:03.732
Simon!


01:16:14.611 --> 01:16:16.678
Don't stop!
Don't stop your legs.


01:16:23.487 --> 01:16:25.421
I got you. I got you.


01:16:27.323 --> 01:16:30.426
I swear to God I can see
headlights on the shore.


01:16:32.262 --> 01:16:34.830
There's someone there
and they're gonna help us.


01:16:37.133 --> 01:16:39.134
All we gotta do is
just get to shore.


01:16:40.670 --> 01:16:42.237
Matt.


01:16:42.239 --> 01:16:43.439
Can you swim, bro?


01:16:43.441 --> 01:16:45.607
What? What?


01:16:45.609 --> 01:16:48.277
Come on. Can you swim, bro?


01:16:48.279 --> 01:16:49.678
- What?
- I'm pretty beat.


01:16:49.680 --> 01:16:51.647
- What?
- I'm pretty beat.


01:16:51.649 --> 01:16:53.148
Come on. Come on.


01:16:58.321 --> 01:16:59.555
Help!


01:17:01.124 --> 01:17:02.191
Help.


01:17:05.261 --> 01:17:06.428
Final vote.


01:19:12.521 --> 01:19:13.921
Oh, my God.


01:19:49.025 --> 01:19:51.859
It's all make-believe,
isn't it?


01:19:51.861 --> 01:19:53.527
It's all make-believe,
isn't it?


01:20:30.667 --> 01:20:32.501
Kitty! Wait!


01:20:32.503 --> 01:20:35.636
No, no... No.


01:20:35.638 --> 01:20:36.904
You killed Matt.


01:20:36.906 --> 01:20:38.072
Wait! Wait!


01:20:38.074 --> 01:20:42.077
You killed Matt. I saw you.
I saw you kill Matt.


01:20:43.779 --> 01:20:44.745
How did you make it?


01:20:45.847 --> 01:20:47.415
You killed your own brother.


01:20:50.519 --> 01:20:51.886
Did Johnny plan all this?


01:20:53.823 --> 01:20:54.889
You're crazy.


01:20:56.391 --> 01:20:58.559
Please. Please,
Simon. Please, let me go.


01:21:01.763 --> 01:21:03.732
No one ever
understood me like you did.


01:21:05.534 --> 01:21:07.902
I do. I do understand you.


01:21:07.904 --> 01:21:09.144
But in the end,
you picked Matt.


01:21:10.706 --> 01:21:13.574
No,
Simon, we could be together.


01:21:13.576 --> 01:21:16.377
We could be...
We could be so good together.


01:21:16.379 --> 01:21:17.845
Together.


01:21:17.847 --> 01:21:19.447
It's the story of my life.


01:22:17.905 --> 01:22:21.175
Never. Never. Never!


01:22:45.901 --> 01:22:47.868
You will never
leave this place.


01:23:12.828 --> 01:23:14.495
- Are you...
- Johnny's friend.


01:23:15.931 --> 01:23:17.465
Yeah, from before.


01:23:18.733 --> 01:23:20.733
Where's Johnny?


01:23:22.036 --> 01:23:23.103
Uh...


01:23:27.209 --> 01:23:28.776
Sir, there's been
a terrible accident.


01:23:30.711 --> 01:23:36.050
That boy, he was very kind.
Like his grandpa.


01:23:37.085 --> 01:23:39.620
I've known his
grandpa all my life.


01:23:39.622 --> 01:23:42.922
Sir, you have no idea what
happened. The nightmare.


01:23:42.924 --> 01:23:45.226
My brother and
my friends are...


01:23:48.530 --> 01:23:50.597
Sir, I tried to save
them and I couldn't.


01:23:50.599 --> 01:23:53.967
Oh, is that what happened?


01:23:53.969 --> 01:23:57.204
Sir, there is a monster.
There is a giant fish.


01:23:57.206 --> 01:24:00.107
I heard about it when I was a kid,
but nobody believed it.


01:24:00.109 --> 01:24:03.810
You kids,
you don't believe anything anymore.


01:24:03.812 --> 01:24:06.780
Sir, I don't think you understand
what I've been through.


01:24:07.582 --> 01:24:09.517
Oh, yeah, I do.


01:24:10.986 --> 01:24:12.552
I've been watching you.


01:24:15.689 --> 01:24:17.291
How did you find that?


01:24:17.293 --> 01:24:20.027
Washed up on the shore.


01:24:20.029 --> 01:24:23.129
Like so many things
better left in the lake.


01:24:25.266 --> 01:24:28.302
Whatever's on that camera
does not tell the whole story.


01:24:28.304 --> 01:24:31.639
Oh, you're such a big shot,
you and your brother.


01:24:31.641 --> 01:24:35.742
Your father
practically owns the town.


01:24:35.744 --> 01:24:39.046
I guess you thought you
could get away with anything.


01:24:39.048 --> 01:24:42.849
Sir, you have... You have no
idea what you're talking about.


01:24:42.851 --> 01:24:44.751
Sir, I need to get help.


01:24:44.753 --> 01:24:48.755
I guess you thought this
would be the end of it.


01:24:49.891 --> 01:24:51.025
What are you doing?


01:24:52.193 --> 01:24:53.960
Don't move.


01:24:53.962 --> 01:24:54.928
What is going on?


01:24:55.829 --> 01:24:58.264
What the hell are you doing?


01:24:58.266 --> 01:25:02.069
I don't think the lake is
finished with you yet, son.


01:25:02.071 --> 01:25:04.904
Sir, please. Please stop.


01:25:04.906 --> 01:25:06.906
Please stop.


01:25:06.908 --> 01:25:13.314
Maybe you'd better move back into
the water and try your luck again.


01:25:14.949 --> 01:25:18.785
No, no. No! I am not
going back out there.


01:25:20.088 --> 01:25:21.755
No! No!


01:25:21.757 --> 01:25:22.957
Ah!


01:25:22.959 --> 01:25:24.991
Ah!


01:25:37.371 --> 01:25:40.807
Stop. Please, stop.


01:25:41.308 --> 01:25:42.842
Please stop!


01:26:01.963 --> 01:26:04.163
No! No!


01:26:09.670 --> 01:26:15.408
No! No! No! No! No! No!


01:26:15.909 --> 01:26:17.276
No!


01:26:17.945 --> 01:26:20.913
No. No! No!


01:26:20.915 --> 01:26:23.049
No! No!

